# Scene2-2-2

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐2
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我吃完早餐，<br>应蕾雅邀请来到了会客厅。|#0202Adv02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:进来以后，发现所有人都已经到齐了。|#0202Adv02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这倒是有点出乎意料……<br>　不，也许有些人只是想法和我一样）|#0202Adv02_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:说吧，你要商量什么事？|#0202Adv02_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你是想到了什么<br>逃出这里的办法吗？|#0202Adv02_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，不是的，抱歉让你们误会了。<br>关于逃出去的方法，我还没有什么主意。|#0202Adv02_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:搞什么嘛，真让人失望！|#0202Adv02_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:面对可可的骂声，<br>蕾雅为难地笑了笑。|#0202Adv02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Coco Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:那你到底要商量什么？|#0202Adv02_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想和大家一起商量，<br>怎么才能让命案不再继续发生。|#0202Adv02_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……那你有什么好主意吗？|#0202Adv02_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对于正在谋划杀害艾玛的我来说，<br>这个话题可不能错过。|#0202Adv02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:是的，希望大家能听我说。|#0202Adv02_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在一众少女的注视下，<br>蕾雅摆出演讲般的架势开口说道。|#0202Adv02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要不发生杀人案件，就不会举行魔女审判。|#0202Adv02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一来至少就不会有人惨遭杀害，<br>也不会有人被残忍处决。|#0202Adv02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正如我先前说的，<br>为此我们一定要团结一心。|#0202Adv02_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说，我们必须深化交流，<br>让彼此更加熟稔起来。|#0202Adv02_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……就是说<br>大家要搞好关系吗？|#0202Adv02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，没错，只要大家搞好关系，对彼此有了情感，<br>发生杀人案的概率就会降低。|#0202Adv02_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然过于亲密<br>也可能会招来摩擦和矛盾，<br>但至少——|#0202Adv02_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:就不太容易因一时冲动而杀人了。<br>|#0202Adv02_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么啊恶心死了！你脑袋被门夹了吗？<br>在这种情况下谁有心情陪你玩朋友过家家！|#0202Adv02_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:你怎么说都可以。<br>我知道大家很难认同，也知道这不是一件易事，<br>但我依然要提出这个方案。|#0202Adv02_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅并没有因为可可的批评而退缩，继续说道。|#0202Adv02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样总比什么都不做更有意义，<br>大家不觉得吗？|#0202Adv02_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:比起这些有的没的，还是努力想办法逃出去<br>更有用啦！|#0202Adv02_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，摸索逃走的办法也很重要。<br>但我们都被囚禁在这里，能做的事实在有限。|#0202Adv02_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，感觉能调查的地方<br>都已经调查个遍了……|#0202Adv02_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:正是如此。所以我觉得<br>也该从其他方向入手，探索生存之道。|#0202Adv02_Leia012| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看起来除了某几个人以外，<br>大部分人对蕾雅的话还是认同的。|#0202Adv02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（寻找活下去的道路是正确的。<br>　只不过……）|#0202Adv02_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我悄悄看向艾玛。<br>接着依次环顾会客厅里的所有人。|#0202Adv02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在的我，已经下定决心要杀艾玛了。<br>　那么，我就不能同意让大家更加亲近的提议）<br>|#0202Adv02_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你说要让大家搞好关系，<br>那具体要做些什么呢？|#0202Adv02_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:哈哈哈，汉娜！<br>真是个好问题！|#0202Adv02_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:像是对这个问题盼望已久似的，<br>蕾雅两眼放光。|#0202Adv02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:要加深我们的友情，<br>就需要大家朝着共同的目标同甘共苦、携手前行。|#0202Adv02_Leia014| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅用戏剧般的肢体语言向众人宣言。<br>|#0202Adv02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:让我们来携手创作舞台剧吧！<br>大家团结一心，共演一幕好戏！|#0202Adv02_Leia015| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HidePrinter
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:……瞬间，房间里鸦雀无声。|#0202Adv02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 拍手音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_125 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:正当我们都被尴尬得愣在原地时，<br>有个不看气氛的人却鼓起掌来。|#0202Adv02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:太棒了！真是个无与伦比的好主意！<br>大家共同朝着一个目标努力……<br>我们的感情一定会更深的！|#0202Adv02_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:舞台剧……是演给谁看的？<br>该不会给典狱长和看守看吧？|#0202Adv02_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:与兴致勃勃的雪莉截然相反，<br>汉娜有些无语地质问道。|#0202Adv02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:囚犯在台上演戏，<br>典狱长和看守在台下看戏——|#0202Adv02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这场面想想就觉得滑稽。|#0202Adv02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，雪莉的积极性带动了其他人，<br>让大家开始你一言我一语地说出自己的看法。|#0202Adv02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_05,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:演戏啊～感觉好好玩！<br>可以呀，诺亚也来帮忙！|#0202Adv02_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『可以考虑』|#0202Adv02_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……随你们便吧。<br>但我不会参加。<br>我有自己必须要做的事。|#0202Adv02_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:……懒得理你们。|#0202Adv02_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我也算了……话说，还演戏呢。<br>现在可不是搞这种事的时候吧。|#0202Adv02_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香、亚里沙和可可三人<br>兴致缺缺地离开了会客厅。|#0202Adv02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:很遗憾，不过这也没办法。<br>……希罗，你怎么想？|#0202Adv02_Leia016| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:我也不参加了吧。<br>没什么心情和你们嬉戏打闹。|#0202Adv02_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在上一起案件的先行投票中，<br>我才刚被当成凶手。|#0202Adv02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅大概也是对此深感内疚，<br>像是带着几分愧疚似的皱起眉。|#0202Adv02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……这样啊，那真的很可惜。|#0202Adv02_Leia017| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说句实话，<br>对被当作凶手一事我已经不再生气了。|#0202Adv02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在那种情况下，就算是我站在她们的立场上，<br>我也会这么投票的。|#0202Adv02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们的判断是正确的。|#0202Adv02_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可是，<br>　我现在已经不能再和你们做朋友了）|#0202Adv02_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见蕾雅的神色如此悲伤，我心怀着几分焦躁与不安<br>离开了会客厅。|#0202Adv02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

