[PrintTextModified Text:——监狱生活第二轮，第十一天。|#0202Adv02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我要杀死魔女。|#0202Adv02_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——杀。杀。杀。杀。<br>杀杀杀杀杀杀杀杀杀杀|#0202Adv02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

